Excluded third-party materials
------------------------------
The original and updated database exports in
02_Search_and_Screening/old_query_outcomes/ and
02_Search_and_Screening/new_query_outcomes/ are third-party search-result records.
The CC BY 4.0 grant above does not apply to their provider-supplied content,
including any third-party abstracts or other material subject to external rights.
The same exclusion applies to original third-party text reproduced in research tables.
Rights held by publishers, database providers and source authors remain unaffected.

Before reposting third-party exports on a public archive, the depositor must verify
that the applicable database and publisher terms permit redistribution. If permission
is uncertain, omit those export directories from the public deposit and retain the
author-created summaries, audits and search documentation instead.
